ck-off meeting for 10:00 AM today, and the meeting link will be sent out by Guoxin Pan shortly. Please, all core director, attend on time."}, {"source_id": 5, "record_author": "Yuni Qin", "recorded_at": "2025-11-04 10:05:25", "text": "Welcome @Zihao Wan to the performance testing family! 😄 I've done similar stress tests on the IoT Health Monitoring System project before, and I have some ready-made JMeter script templates, including parameterization, assertions, and listener configurations. I'll organize them and send them to you; they should save you a lot of time."}, {"source_id": 6, "record_author": "Qingni Jiang", "recorded_at": "2025-11-20 17:45:50", "text": "@all The system security scan task has been completed. The last round of scanning and regression testing has concluded. The P0 vulnerabilities previously found have been confirmed as fixed, and no new high-risk issues have been discovered. The final security report has been uploaded to the project space."}, {"source_id": 7, "record_author": "Weihua Zhang", "recorded_at": "2025-11-11 17:30:00", "text": "Excellent, the team responds to issues very quickly. @Jun Chen @Peng Sun please release the fix as soon as possible. @all Colleagues who haven't participated in the testing yet, please take some time to experience it before leaving work today or tomorrow. Thank you all for your support!"}, {"source_id": 8, "record_author": "Peng Sun", "recorded_at": "2025-11-11 16:50:00", "text": "Update progress: The fix for the high-risk privilege escalation vulnerability has passed regression testing, and the issue is resolved. @Jun Chen We can prepare to package this fix with a few other P1-level bugs and release an emergency hotfix version."}]}

